# NDA hygiene — a staged commercial 180 nm NDA PDK is consumed by the analog
# track via symlinks under input/pdk/ (SPICE model libs + sign-off SVRF decks)
# to an out-of-repo self-contained stage. That content, and any ngspice sim
# scratch that embeds native model-lib paths or quotes native model text, must
# NEVER be committed. These subtrees are excluded from git.
input/pdk/
phase3/analog/*/sizing_loop/
